OL,3,GNEWSAFeud murder accused 'fuming' at
OL,4,Avictim's brother
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused alongside his father and
OL,7,Fbrother of murdering a man in a feud
OL,8,Fhas told jurors he was "fuming" at the
OL,9,Fvictim's brother after a spate of
OL,10,Fincidents.
OL,12,FDaniel Ambler, 23, was killed by a car
OL,13,Fdriven by Ashton Anderson at a petrol
OL,14,Fstation in Seaham, County Durham, in
OL,15,FJanuary, after months of incidents
OL,16,Fbetween their families, Teesside Crown
OL,17,FCourt heard.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
