OL,3,GNEWSAFeud murder accused 'fuming' at
OL,4,Avictim's brother
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarry Anderson, 52, and his sons
OL,7,FAshton, 20, and Logan, 19, deny murder,
OL,8,Fas do Tyler Leadbetter and Ajay Henry,
OL,9,Fboth 18, who were passengers in the
OL,10,Fcar.
OL,12,FLogan Anderson, who hit the victim with
OL,13,Fa hammer before the fatal crash, said
OL,14,Fthere was no family plan to attack
OL,15,FDaniel Ambler or his brother David.
